This directory is empty on purpose, and it has to exist.

It is the -I anchor the Makefile points at (I915_IMPORT_CFLAGS) so that the
`#include "../../../platform/x86/intel_ips.h"` in the imported
gt/intel_rps.c resolves to the shim two levels up, at
kernel/include/i915-shim/rel/drivers/platform/x86/intel_ips.h.

Git does not track empty directories, so without this file a fresh clone or
worktree has no anchor, and every i915 build fails on that one include.
